sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as ODH Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModuleOp as Module Operator<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer CR
    participant Operand as mcp-lifecycle-operator<br/>8081/TCP, 8443/TCP, 9443/TCP
    participant Webhook as Operand Conversion<br/>Webhook 9443/TCP

    Note over Platform,Webhook: Flow 1: Platform-Triggered Operand Deployment

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Watch event (MCPLifecycleOperator)<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Read OpenShift APIServer CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: TLS profile (min version, ciphers)

    Note over ModuleOp: Render operand manifests<br/>(kustomize + embed.FS)<br/>Inject namespace, image, TLS config

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply operand manifests<br/>(Deployment, CRDs, RBAC, NetworkPolicy,<br/>cert-manager, webhooks, ServiceMonitor)<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+

    Note over ModuleOp: Garbage collect stale resources

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Check operand Deployment readiness<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Deployment status

    Note over Platform,Webhook: Flow 2: MCPServer Conversion Health Check

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: LIST MCPServers at v1beta1<br/>(paginated, bounded restart)<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Conversion webhook call<br/>HTTPS/9443 TLS (cert-manager)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Converted MCPServer objects
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: MCPServer list response

    alt Conversion succeeds
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Create StorageVersionMigration<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Patch MCPLifecycleOperator status<br/>(version handshake complete)<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    else Conversion fails
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Patch MCPLifecycleOperator status<br/>(conversion error condition)<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    end
